          "args_hex": [
            "00FF",
            "0101"
          ]
        },
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 20,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0028"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 7,
      "label": "kizuna_health_b_07",
      "hash64": "D8FBA879A0491DA3",
      "text": "小孩子真是厲害～……\\n每天都在挑戰新事物。[VAR 0x0114(0028)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 21,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0028"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 8,
      "label": "kizuna_health_b_08",
      "hash64": "D8FBB579A04933BA",
      "text": "相較之下……[VAR 0x0114(0028)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 6,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0028"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 9,
      "label": "kizuna_health_b_09",
      "hash64": "D8FBB679A049356D",
      "text": "……我以前的夢想是\\n成為學校的老師～[VAR 0x0114(0028)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 18,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0028"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 10,
      "label": "kizuna_health_b_10",
      "hash64": "D8FF3379A04C3FAB",
      "text": "啊，現在我是學校的護理師，\\n沒辦法教課的。[VAR 0x0114(0028)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 21,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0028"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 11,
      "label": "kizuna_health_b_11",
      "hash64": "D8FF3279A04C3DF8",
      "text": "健教教師的考試，\\n我一直考不過～[VAR 0x0114(0028)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 16,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0028"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 12,
      "label": "kizuna_health_b_12",
      "hash64": "D8FF3579A04C4311",
      "text": "不論挑戰幾次都失敗，\\n結果我就在醫務室裡得過且過了。[VAR 0x0114(0028)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 26,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0028"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 13,
      "label": "kizuna_health_b_13",
      "hash64": "D8FF3479A04C415E",
      "text": "啊，對不起。\\n竟然跟[VAR 0x1100(00FF,0101)]你妳說這麼沉重的話。[VAR 0x0114(0028)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 10,
          "count": 3,
          "code_hex": "1100",
          "args_hex": [
            "00FF",
            "0101"
          ]
        },
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 25,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0028"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 14,
      "label": "kizuna_health_b_14",
      "hash64": "D8FF3779A04C4677",
      "text": "因為[VAR 0x1100(00FF,0101)]你妳實在太擅長聽別人說話了，\\n讓人忍不住會一直說。[VAR 0x0114(0028)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 2,
          "count": 3,
          "code_hex": "1100",
          "args_hex": [
            "00FF",
            "0101"
          ]
        },
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 32,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0028"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
